{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/x8pjzy","slideIndex":2,"text":"Random state is 42. Continuous numeric columns are median-imputed with missingness indicators and standardized. Categories use mode imputation and one-hot encoding. Both steps are fitted only on training data by the pipeline. Logistic regression and a depth-limited decision tree use balanced class weights. The model with higher validation ROC AUC is selected, then refit on all development data before the final test evaluation."}
