{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/q71ibm","slideIndex":3,"text":"Validation ROC AUC was 0.870 for logistic regression and 0.815 for the decision tree. After selecting logistic regression by validation ROC AUC, both candidates were refit on the full 80% development split. On the untouched 20% test set, logistic regression scores 0.832 accuracy, 0.838 precision, 0.863 recall, 0.850 F1, and 0.908 ROC AUC. The decision tree scores 0.810, 0.853, 0.794, 0.822, and 0.882 respectively. Each metric uses the positive class as disease present, and the threshold is the default 0.5."}
